sequenceDiagram
    title SD-06 - Payment Registration
    participant P0 as Accountant
    participant P1 as Payment UI
    participant P2 as Payment Service
    participant P3 as Finance Repository
    participant P4 as Database
    P0->>P1: Select enrollment, charges, amount
    P1->>P2: recordPayment(allocations)
    P2->>P2: Authorize + positive amount + full allocation
    P2->>P3: beginTransaction(), lock charges
    P3->>P4: SELECT charges FOR UPDATE
    P4->>P3: Current outstanding balances
    P2->>P2: Check same enrollment, no overpayment
    P2->>P3: insertPaymentAndAllocations()
    P3->>P4: INSERT payment + allocations, COMMIT
    P4->>P3: Payment ID / rollback
    P3->>P2: Transaction result
    Note over P2: alt: receipt or rejected amount
    P1->>P0: Display receipt / validation error
